          deckDescription: 'A standard 52-card French deck; no jokers. Pitch Fish combines pitch-style bidding or trump with fishing: players capture table cards by matching rank or with certain cards; scoring may include pitch points and fishing points.',
          suitDescription: 'The four French suits (hearts, diamonds, clubs, spades) each have thirteen cards. Trump (if used) is set by bid or turn-up; suit and rank determine captures and trick winners according to the variant.',
